{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Preserve the existing plugin dispatch-order contract.** `PluginRunner` previously documented and implemented registration-order dispatch for every hook. Reversing `onInvocationEnd` changes observable behavior for existing multi-plugin configurations and can invert established flush or cleanup dependencies. Retain registration order, or introduce an explicit opt-in LIFO scope mechanism for plugins requiring reverse unwinding.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77QAYw","finding_digest":"228b02e451d041f1350baeb06c1087e868a78673c95bfbe462221502988bf67c","finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","line":110,"observation_digest":"aae1fe116ecc2248bd76c7eeb6a4a1ef3924d027e0c77120fe7a08c1b8c72000","observation_id":"aro_v1_vlq74elozqrerplwy7xlnjfb54","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","published_at":"2026-10-08T05:44:14Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ujohmip6mlep7p7lfksixhq4vk","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"00c12717417954984b3c3dea73b86b1cbb241039","reviewer":"codex","start_line":110,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_n2kmq2x5trubygqi7pbkflltb7","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T05:44:14Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
